# Frontend UI data

This app does **not** use Lucide, Heroicons, shadcn, or Font Awesome.

## Stack

- Vue 3 Composition API + **Naive UI**
- Icons: **`@vicons/ionicons5`** (Outline only) via `<n-icon :component="…" />`
- Theme tokens: `client/src/styles/global.css` + `html[data-theme="dark|light"]`
- Naive theme: `darkTheme` / `themeOverrides` in `client/src/App.vue`

## Icons — how to use

```vue
<n-icon :component="EyeOutline" :size="14" />
```

```ts
import { EyeOutline, DownloadOutline } from "@vicons/ionicons5";
h(NIcon, { component: EyeOutline, class: "btn-icon" })
```

- Compact actions: 14–16px. App bar: 18–22px.
- Icon-only controls: `btn btn--ghost btn--xs icon-btn` + `n-tooltip`.
- Do not mix filled/outline sets. Do not use emoji as UI icons.

## Theme

Use CSS variables (`var(--brand-color)`, `var(--bg-card)`, `var(--text-primary)`, `var(--border-color)`). Brand: `#63e2b7` (dark) / `#18a058` (light). Fonts: `--font-ui` / `--font-base` start with Segoe UI (Hebrew). Tailwind exists but is not the icon or component system.

Hebrew pages: `dir="rtl"`. Admin English: `dir="ltr"`. Naive `n-data-table` often misaligns in RTL — prefer a custom `<table>` when headers/body drift.
